GET /client/v4/billing/rate_plans/{public_key}
Gets a rate plan's details by its public key (e.g., 'teams_free', 'cf_pro_20_20'). This is a public catalog endpoint, so authentication is not enforced and credentials are accepted but not required.
Required: public_key (path) — The public key identifier for the rate plan.

POST /client/v4/workers/builds/deploy_hooks/{deploy_hook_uuid}
Trigger a build using a deploy hook. This endpoint does not require authentication - the deploy_hook_uuid acts as a secret token.
Required: deploy_hook_uuid (path) — Deploy hook UUID
